 "title": "GCM1885C2A221JA16: 220 pF, 100 V DC, C0G, 0603 (1608M) automotive multilayer ceramic chip capacitor",
 "source": {
  "revision": "GCM1885C2A221JA16-01A, specifications as of Apr.7,2026",
  "pages": 32
 },
 "summary": "A 220 pF ±5% multilayer ceramic chip capacitor in the 1.6 × 0.8 × 0.8 mm (EIA 0603) size, with a C0G (Murata code 5C) class-1 dielectric whose temperature coefficient is 0 ±30 ppm/°C. It is rated 100 V DC and works from -55 to 125 °C. It belongs to the GCM series for automotive powertrain and safety equipment and is qualified to AEC-Q200 Rev.D. It can be flow or reflow soldered; the four ordering codes differ only in reel size and tape pitch.",
